<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us</title>
    <style>
      /* General Styles */
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #121212;
        color: #e0e0e0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        color: #bb86fc;
      }

      p,
      a {
        color: #e0e0e0;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: #3700b3;
      }

      /* Header Styles */
      header {
        background: #1e1e1e;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #bb86fc;
      }

      header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 3rem;
      }

      /* Container */
      .container {
        width: 90%;
        margin: auto;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      /* History Section */
      .history {
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 20px;
        background: #1e1e1e;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      .history h2 {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      /* Band Member Section */
      .band-member {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        margin: 20px 0;
        background: #1e1e1e;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      .band-member img {
        width: 150px;
        height: 150px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin-right: 20px;
        border: 3px solid #bb86fc;
      }

      .band-member-info h3 {
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 15px 0;
        background: #1e1e1e;
        border-top: 3px solid #bb86fc;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #bb86fc;
      }

      .footer a:hover {
        color: #e0e0e0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
      <h1>About the Band</h1>
    </header>
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="container">
      <!-- History Section -->
      <section class="history">
        <h2>Band History</h2>
        <p> Stage Fright was formed when lead singer <b>Jadyn Mallory</b> and lead guitarist <b>Brady Miles</b> met at a Seattle music festival, bonding over their mutual love for gritty, emotional rock. Jaiden, a Portland native with indie roots and a degree in music theory, brought his raw vocal power and songwriting skills, while Brady, a surf-rock keyboardist from Huntington Beach, added captivating beats. They soon expanded, recruiting bassist <b>Juno Vargas</b>, a San Diego native with a jazz background and a talent for the bass guitar. <b>Seth Callahan</b>, previously friends with Juno, joined as the drummer. Together, they fused their diverse talents to create the powerful, emotional sound of Stage Fright. </p>
      </section>
      <!-- Band Members Section -->
      <section class="members">
        <div class="band-member">
          <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/wM9CLf73/Screenshot-2024-11-21-5-18-12-PM.png" alt="Jaiden Mallory">
          <div class="band-member-info">
            <h3>Jaiden “Ace” Mallory</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Position:</strong> Lead Singer and Lead Guitarist
            </p>
            <p>Jaiden “Ace” Mallory came from Portland, Oregon, where he was raised by a family of indie musicians. His unique voice and stage presence developed from years of performing at local open mic nights, blending his love for rock with influences from his parents' eclectic music collection. After earning a degree in music theory from the University of Washington, Jaiden pursued songwriting and performing, eventually crossing paths with Brady during a Seattle music festival. The two quickly bonded and formed Stage Fright.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="band-member">
          <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/FHY2yJsb/Screenshot-2024-11-21-5-21-44-PM.png" alt="Brady Miles">
          <div class="band-member-info">
            <h3>Brady “Chad” Miles</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Position:</strong> Keyboardist
            </p>
            <p>Brady Miles, known as "Chad," grew up in Huntington Beach, California. Starting at age 10, he developed his skills playing classic rock. After attending the Musicians Institute in Los Angeles, Brady’s electrifying solos became a hallmark of Stage Fright’s sound.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="band-member">
          <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/TwJSdVCx/Screenshot-2024-11-21-5-25-04-PM.png" alt="Juno Vargas">
          <div class="band-member-info">
            <h3>Juno “Bassline” Vargas</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Position:</strong> Bass Guitar
            </p>
            <p>Hailing from San Diego, Juno Vargas was inspired by his jazz musician father and artist mother. After studying music production at the University of Michigan, Juno joined Stage Fright, bringing deep grooves and technical mastery to the band.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="band-member">
          <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/d04rJDrX/Screenshot-2024-11-21-5-26-24-PM.png" alt="Seth Callahan">
          <div class="band-member-info">
            <h3>Seth "Bones" Callahan</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>Position:</strong> Drummer
            </p>
            <p>Seth Callahan grew up in the small town of Vale Haven. His passion for rhythm started with an old drum kit and grew into a lifelong obsession. Known for his energetic style, Seth is the heartbeat of Stage Fright.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <p>Follow us on <a href="#">Social Media</a> | © 2024 Stage Fright </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
